# Player lock test, 12 seats = 6v6 (Control mode preset order):
#   NHL94_SEATS=home:C,away:C,home:LW,away:LW,home:RW,away:RW,home:LD,away:LD,home:RD,away:RD,home:G,away:G
# (menu: Head to Head, 30-second periods). PLAYER n = seat n-1; seats 5..12
# are virtual pads. Per period: all twelve hold at once (s0 UP, s1 UP, s2 LEFT,
# s3 LEFT, s4 RIGHT, s5 RIGHT, s6 DOWN, s7 DOWN, s8 RIGHT, s9 LEFT, s10 LEFT,
# s11 RIGHT) for 120 frames, then seats 5..12 one at a time hold RIGHT for
# 40 frames. With an engine of fewer than 12 pads per tick the seats beyond
# it get no input and stay AI.
WAIT 600
PRESS START 5
WAIT 120
PRESS START 5
WAIT 120
PRESS DOWN 5
WAIT 20
PRESS RIGHT 5
WAIT 20
PRESS RIGHT 5
WAIT 20
PRESS RIGHT 5
WAIT 20
PRESS START 5
WAIT 240
PRESS START 5
WAIT 240
WRITE_RAM16 0xFFD050 0x0003
PRESS START 5
WAIT 420
